WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:07.690
We're foot—slog—slog—slog—sloggin' over Africa—

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:13.030
Foot—foot—foot—foot—sloggin' over Africa—

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:18.740
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.990
There's no discharge in the war!

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:27.280
Seven—six—eleven—five—nine-an'-twenty mile to-day—

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.350
Four—eleven—seventeen—thirty-two the day before—

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:37.020
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:40.080
There's no discharge in the war!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.240
Don't—don't—don't—don't—look at what's in front of you.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:50.460
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.820
Men—men—men—men—men go mad with watchin' 'em,

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.840
An' there's no discharge in the war!

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:04.040
Count—count—count—count—the bullets in the bandoliers.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.880
If—your—eyes—drop—they will get atop o' you!

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:14.380
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.490
There's no discharge in the war!

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:22.470
We—can—stick—out—'unger, thirst, an' weariness,

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:27.500
But—not—not—not—not the chronic sight of 'em—

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:32.960
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.960
An' there's no discharge in the war!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.730
'Tain't—so—bad—by—day because o' company,

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:45.580
But night—brings—long—strings—o' forty thousand million

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.930
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:53.590
There's no discharge in the war!

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:58.700
I—'ave—marched—six—weeks in 'Ell an' certify

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:03.050
It—is—not—fire—devils, dark, or anything,

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:08.890
But boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again,

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.950
An' there's no discharge in the war!

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:17.070
Try—try—try—try—to think o' something different—

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:22.190
Oh—my—God—keep—me from goin' lunatic!

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:27.760
Boots—boots—boots—boots—movin' up an' down again!

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:31.000
There's no discharge in the war!
